<title>POLAND: INVSTORS BID FOR PLN 867 MLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>INVSTORS BID FOR PLN 867 MLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 867 million zlotys of Polish T-bills at the treasury's 950 million zloty primary auction, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
